# Dreadhorde Invasion: "Whenever a Zombie token you control with power 6 or greater attacks, it gains lifelink until end of
# turn." One short of the limit does nothing: the Army is a 2/2 by turn 5 and one Giant Growth makes it 5/5, so its attack
# takes 5 life from Bot2 without giving Bot1 any back.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Dreadhorde Invasion
Mox Jet
Forest
Giant Growth
Giant Growth
Mox Emerald
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dreadhorde Invasion.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Zombie Army Token)
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Zombie Army Token > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.End]

